    "body": "And also whether a proxy for a DOM interface object ends up with a construct trap being called.  So simple testcase:\r\n```\r\n<script>\r\n  var p = new Proxy(Node, { construct: () => console.log(\"constructing\") });\r\n  new p()\r\n</script>\r\n```\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
