    "updated_at": "2019-03-26T15:10:22Z",
    "body": "On that testcase, Chrome and Firefox log \"constructing\"; Safari does not (and the exception it throws is about `p` not being a constructor).  Yay interop.  ;)\r\n\r\nBut OK, if we want to spec Chrome/Firefox behavior here then we need to change something in the idl spec.",
